- Unity packages listed in Packages/manifest.json are not included here; Unity
  downloads them under the Unity Companion License / Unity Terms of Service.

AI-generated assets (Meshy 3D models, Google Gemini/Veo voice and video) are
used under the terms of those services; see README.md, "Asset credits".
